OL,3,GNEWSAUS removes all bombers from RAF
OL,4,AFairford base
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has withdrawn all of its bombers
OL,7,Ffrom RAF Fairford, the UK military base
OL,8,Fat the centre of an incident being
OL,9,Finvestigated by counter terror police.
OL,11,FA statement from a US department
OL,12,Fofficial confirmed on Sunday it had
OL,13,Fremoved its bombers - thought to be
OL,14,Fabout a dozen B-1s - from the base back
OL,15,Fto their home stations in America.
OL,17,FThe US did not give a reason for the
OL,18,Fwithdrawal, but it follows a major
OL,19,Fincident on 27 September when police
OL,20,Fwere alerted to three "suspicious
OL,21,Fvehicles" near the airbase.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
